cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this experiment, its data or its code, please cite it with the metadata below."
type: software
title: "Fork in the Bill: a pre-registered Flagsmith experiment on a coding agent's model routing"
abstract: >-
  A pre-registered A/B experiment, run through Flagsmith, on whether handing a coding
  agent's routine work to a small model cuts the dollars spent per solved task. The
  repository holds the registrations, the run logs with hash-chained ledgers, the
  analysis that derives every published number, and the tools to verify all of it.
authors:
  - name: "Fork in the Bill team (CoffeeAndToggle)"
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-27"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/Prashant-thakur77/fork-in-the-bill"
keywords:
  - feature flags
  - A/B testing
  - pre-registration
  - coding agents
  - model routing
